  1. Enable Allow HTTP Requests in Studio’s Security settings.
  2. Add Local Secret BattleWorksStudioWorlds using the private Studio key (/
     tmp/battleworks-http-credentials/Studio-key.txt), domain groupboard.app.

  3. Let Rojo sync, restart Play, import your backup JSON, and click Save.

  For published servers, configure BattleWorksLiveWorlds using the private live
  key (/tmp/battleworks-http-credentials/Live-key.txt).

